        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSUT, Solid Brass Urn Finial</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAn easy screw-on installation makes this hinge finial an effortless way to add the finishes details that help turn a house into a beautiful home. The Urn finial is made by Deltana out of durable solid brass so you know it will last though years of continuous use.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAll Deltana decorative finials are available in matching finishes and fit interchangeably with  <a href=\"/collections/deltana-brass-hinges\"><b>Deltana Solid Brass Hinges</b></a> (except <a href=\"/products/6-x-6-x-square-corners-heavy-duty-with-ball-bearing-solid-brass-hinge-pair-dsb66bb\"> 6\" x 6\" Brass Hinge</a>).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHinge Finials (tips) are packaged and sold individually. Order 2 per hinge, if you want finials on both the top and bottom of the hinge.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Urn Tip Finial:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thread: 8mm x 1.25mm thread</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Easy screw-on installation</li>\r\n<li>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\" target=\"new\">finishes</a>, but no matter which finish you choose, the base metal will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana PVD Finish (CR003) is recommended for harsh environments such as high salt or intense temperatures; it has the appearance of polished brass but without the ordinary problems such as easy tarnishing, discoloration, flaking, or pitting commonly associated with a standard polished brass finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Urn Tip Solid Brass Finial, Deltana DSUT",
                "description": "Deltana DSUT Urn Cabinet Finial - An easy screw-on installation makes this cabinet hinge finial an effortless way to add the finishes details that help turn a house into a beautiful home. The Acorn cabinet finial is made by Deltana out of durable solid brass so you know it will last though years of continuous use. Available in 9 finishes.",
                "keywords": "Urn Tip Solid Brass Finial, Deltana DSUT, urn hinge tip, hinge final, deltana urn tips, brass hinge tips urn tip, solid brass finials, DEL-DSUT14, DEL-DSUT10B, DEL-DSUT15, DEL-DSUT15A, DEL-DSUT19, DEL-DSUT26, DEL-DSUT26D, DEL-DSUT3, DEL-DSUT3-UNL, DEL-DSUT4, DEL-DSUT5, DEL-CUT1,"
